    {
      "type": "header",
      "data": {
        "text": "保罗第一次宣教之旅，公元46-48 年",
        "level": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "data": {
        "text": "<br> 此时期涵盖了圣灵从安提阿的教会差遣第一支团队进行宣教之旅。重要的事迹有：神迹奇事的发生、在各会堂教导人、教会的建立。此阶段可看到在不同情况下，使人作门徒的例子。"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "data": {
        "text": "<br> 24. 教会差派宣教士——教会差传的开始（徒 13:1-12）<br> 25. 省会犹太人宣教——异地同文化宣教（徒13:13-43）<br> 26. 省会外邦人宣教——异地跨文化宣教（徒13:44-52）<br> 27. 城市传基督宣教——城市的宣教策略（徒14:1-7）<br> 28. 城镇行神迹宣教——城镇的宣教策略（徒14:8-20）<br> 29. 回程坚固初信徒——坚固初信徒信心（徒14:21-28）<br> 30. 论外邦信主条件——开放跨文化信仰（徒15:1-3）"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "data": {
        "text": "<span class=\"zoom\"><img src=\"/sites/mc2/content/M2/cmn/images/custom/image2.png\"></span>"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "data": {
        "text": "<span class=\"zoom\"><img src=\"/sites/mc2/content/M2/cmn/images/custom/image3.png\"></span>"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "data": {
        "text": "<span lang=\"ZH-CN\"><span style=\"background-color:white\">保罗第二次传道旅程，把福音传到了欧洲，先是马其顿后是希腊，在哥林多写了帖撒罗尼迦前书后书，加拉太书也可能是在哥林多所写：</span></span>"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "data": {
        "style": "ordered",
        "items": [
          {
            "text": "<span lang=\"ZH-CN\"><span style=\"background-color:white\">保罗和巴拿巴被差遣从耶路撒冷到安提阿（徒</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"background-color:white\">15:22-38</span></span><span lang=\"ZH-CN\"><span style=\"background-color:white\">）</span></span>"
          },
          {
            "text": "<span lang=\"ZH-CN\"><span style=\"background-color:white\">保罗和巴拿巴因马可起了争执，巴拿巴和马可去塞浦路斯（徒</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"background-color:white\">15:39</span></span><span lang=\"ZH-CN\"><span style=\"background-color:white\">）</span></span>"
          },
          {
            "text": "<span lang=\"ZH-CN\"><span style=\"background-color:white\">保罗走遍叙利亚和基利家坚固众教会（徒</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"background-color:white\">15:40-41</span></span><span lang=\"ZH-CN\"><span style=\"background-color:white\">）</span></span>"
          },
          {
            "text": "<span lang=\"ZH-CN\"><span style=\"background-color:white\">保罗到特庇、路司得和以哥念（徒</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"background-color:white\">16:1-5</span></span><span lang=\"ZH-CN\"><span style=\"background-color:white\">）</span></span>"
          },
          {
            "text": "<span lang=\"ZH-CN\"><span style=\"background-color:white\">圣灵禁止保罗在亚细亚传道，保罗就经弗吕家、加拉太、每西亚，在每西亚的边界想去庇推尼，圣灵却不许，他们就越过每西亚下到特罗亚，保罗夜间看见马其顿的异象（徒</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"background-color:white\">16:6-10</span></span><span lang=\"ZH-CN\"><span style=\"background-color:white\">）</span></span>"
          },
          {
            "text": "<span lang=\"ZH-CN\"><span style=\"background-color:white\">保罗到腓立比（徒</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"background-color:white\">16:11-40</span></span><span lang=\"ZH-CN\"><span style=\"background-color:white\">）</span></span>"
          },
          {
            "text": "<span lang=\"ZH-CN\"><span style=\"background-color:white\">保罗到帖撒罗尼迦、庇哩亚（徒</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"background-color:white\">17:1-14</span></span><span lang=\"ZH-CN\"><span style=\"background-color:white\">）</span></span>"
          },
          {
            "text": "<span lang=\"ZH-CN\"><span style=\"background-color:white\">保罗到雅典、哥林多，在哥林多住了一年半（徒</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"background-color:white\">17:15-18:18</span></span><span lang=\"ZH-CN\"><span style=\"background-color:white\">）</span></span>"
          },
          {
            "text": "<span lang=\"ZH-CN\"><span style=\"background-color:white\">保罗到以弗所（徒</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"background-color:white\">18:19-21</span></span><span lang=\"ZH-CN\"><span style=\"background-color:white\">）</span></span>"
          },
          {
            "text": "<span lang=\"ZH-CN\"><span style=\"background-color:white\">经凯撒利亚返耶路撒冷（徒</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"background-color:white\">18:22</span></span><span lang=\"ZH-CN\"><span style=\"background-color:white\">）</span></span>"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "data": {
        "text": "（<span lang=\"ZH-CN\">以下</span>图片与内容取自：<a href=\"https://cmcbiblereading.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/10/118.gif\" style=\"color:#0563c1; text-decoration:underline\">https://cmcbiblereading.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/10/118.gif</a><span class=\"MsoHyperlink\" style=\"color:#0563c1\"><u>）</u></span>"
      }
    }
  ]
}
